      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshiakabidi Dî dia Yehowa wa misumba diakalua kundi ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wa misumba udi wamba ne, Ndi munvue mukau bua Siona, nakukuatshika tshiji tshikole bua bualu buandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa udi wamba ne, Nempingane ku Siona, nenshikame munkatshi mua Yelushalema; nebabikile Yelushalema ne, Musoko wa kungeyemena; nebabikile mukuna wa Yehowa wa misumba ne, Mukuna wa tshijila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wa misumba udi wamba ne, Bantu banunu, balume ne bakashi, nebashikame kabidi mu misesu ya mu Yelushalema, muntu ne muntu ne tshibangu tshiandi mu tshianza bualu bua bidimu biandi biakavulangana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Misesu ya mu musoko neyikale tente ne bana ba balume ne bana ba bakashi banaya mu misesu yau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wa misumba udi wamba ne, Bikala bualu ebu bualu bua kukema ku mesu kua bantu aba ba mu matuku au, nebuikale kabidi bua kukema ku mesu kuanyi, anyi? Edi ndikonka dia Yehowa wa misumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wa misumba udi wamba ne, Monai, nempatule bantu banyi mu buloba bua ku luseke ludi diba dihatuka ne mu buloba bua ku luseke ludi diba dibuela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nembahingashe bua kushikamabo munkatshi mua Yelushalema, nebikale bantu banyi, ne meme nengikale Nzambi wabo mu bushuwa ne mu buakane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wa misumba udi wamba ne, Koleshai maboko enu; nuenu badi bunvua mei â a mu matuku â mukana mua baprofete bakadiku mu dituku diakajadikabo bishimikidi bia nsubu wa Yehowa wa misumba, ntempelo eu mene, bua kumuibakabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua ku mpala kua matuku au muntu kakaheta difutu ku mudimu wandi, anyi difutu ku mudimu wa bimuna biandi; muntu yonso wakaluhuka anyi wakabuela kakadi ne ditalala bualu bua bena lukuna bandi; bualu bua nakasonsola bantu bonso bua muntu ne muntu aluishe muena mutumba nʼandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wa misumba udi wamba ne, Katataka tshiena bu munakadi mu matuku a diambedi kudi difuka dia bantu aba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebakune maminu ne ditalala, nebahete diakalengele; muonshi wa tumuma neukuame tumuma tuau, buloba nebulue ne bintu bia kudia biabu, diulu nedilokeshe dibungi, nengenzeshe difuka edi dia bantu aba bua kuhianabo bintu ebi bionso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bu munuakadi bantu bedibue mulau munkatshi mua bisamba bia bantu, nuenu Bena Yuda ne Bena Isalele, nunku ndi musue kunuhandisha, ne nenulue bantu badi basankisha bakuabo. Kanutshinyi, maboko enu ikale ne bukole.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua Yehowa wa misumba udi wamba ne, Bu munakela meji bua kunuenzela bibi, bakankuatshisha batatu benu tshiji, ne tshiakakudimuna mutshima wanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nunku, nakuhangidisha mu matuku â bua kuenzela Yelushalema ne Bena Yuda bimpe. Kanutshinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nudi ne bua kuenza malu â. Ambilanganai mei a bushuwa, buonso buenu, muntu ne muntu ne muena mutumba nʼandi; kosai bilumbu mu bilumbuluidi bidi ku bibuelelu bia musoko ne kulumbulula kua bushuwa ne kua ditalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa udi wamba ne, Nansha umue wa munkatshi muenu kahangidishi bualu mu mutshima wandi bua kuenzeleye muena mutumba nʼandi bibi; kanunangi mutshihu wa mashimi, bualu bua ndi nkina malu â onso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dî dia Yehowa wa misumba diakalua kundi kabidi ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Edi ndî didi Yehowa wa misumba wamba ne, Kujila kua bia kudia kua mu ngondo muinai, kua mu ngondo muitanu, kua mu ngondo wa muanda mutekete ne kua mu ngondo wa dikumi, nekuikale bu masanka ne musangelu, ne bu bikondo bia bia kudia bia disanka kudi Bena Yuda. Nunku suai bushuwa ne ditalala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wa misumba udi wamba ne, Bantu nebalue kabidi, bafume mu misoko ya bungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba mu musoko mukuabo nebaye ku mukuabo bamba ne, Tuyai lukasa bua kulengesha ne Yehowa, ne bua kukeba Yehowa wa misumba. Tuetu netuye hetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu bavule ne ba mu bisamba bia bukole nebalue kukeba Yehowa wa misumba mu Yelushalema ne bua kulengesha nʼandi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wa misumba udi wamba dî edi ne, Mu matuku au bantu dikumi ba mu muaku ne mu muaku nebakuate ku luzemba lua tshivuali tshia Muena Yuda, bamuambila ne, Tudi basue kuya nʼebe, bualu bua tuakunvua ne Nzambi udi nʼebe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
